## THE THREE P1s

### V80-D1 (NEW THIS ROUND) — a clause-final test built from a list of what may follow

`MN_READ_PREDICATE_FINAL` lets exactly **nine** things follow the read predicate. Mongolian has many more sentence-final particles and none is a verb (`юм`, `аа`, `ээ`, `билээ`, `гэнэ`, `шүү дээ`, `л дээ`). A read carrying one stops being a read; `хаа`/`оноо` — the stems that are also ordinary words — make the clause a live command; `requestRefusesEveryMutation` returns false and **every mutating field the model supplied survives the strip at `:4405`**.

`Alpha-г битгий устга. Хаа сайгүй ийм асуудал байна шүү дээ.` — V78-D2's own counter-example with the commonest emphatic pair on the end — **is not a refusal.**

| build | ordinary requests swallowed (10) | forbidden writes that survive (12) |
|---|---|---|
| `924977e4` | 4 | 11 |
| `992520d8` | 7 | **0** |
| **`dc27e034`** | 2 | **8** |
| + prepared fix | 2 | **0** |

### V80-D2 (NEW THIS ROUND) — the arm added to close a fabrication path learned two words

`no record of (a|an|any) <type> (called|named)` misses `with that name` / `by that name` / `with the name`; the new `not registered (?!for|with|as|to)` exclusion swallows `not registered **with** your workspace`.

| build | fabricated denials that escape (29) | truthful sentences rewritten (24) |
|---|---|---|
| `992520d8` | **0** | 24 |
| **`dc27e034`** | **8** | 12 |
| + prepared fix | 4 | 11 |

Both halves are contract violations: §3.5 (a state claim must be grounded) and §3.2 (*"a text-shape rule … may never be the sole reason a response is accepted or **rewritten**"* — at `:8187` this pattern is the only reason).

Also: `no such (?!thing|option|luck)` does not cover the plural — "There are no such **things** as partial archives." still matches.

### V80-D4 (PRE-EXISTING, NEVER MEASURED IN THIS DIRECTION) — a store is not a type

`DENIAL_SUBJECT`'s `\bis\s+no\s+([a-z]+)` reads **`record`** out of *"There is no record of a company called ACME"* because "is" starts earlier than "no". `record` matches no bucket, the type-agreement check refuses the edit, and **the fabrication ships on a turn that canonically READ the row it denies** — including the exact sentence this round's own comment cites as the thing it fixed.

Executed on the shipped window: **4 of 8** contradicted denials ship on the candidate; **0 of 8** with the fix.

